{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0373_1000_p", "source_sha256": "63331b2e5cae2dd1adf11ce56154fb419bcc9d4070a774a57400fc1a22123514", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影日だ。\n亜利沙は着替えに行っているが……ずいぶん遅いな？）", "zh": "（今天是拍摄写真杂志《偶像写真！！》的日子。\n亚利沙去换衣服了，可是……怎么这么久还没回来？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0373_1001_p", "source_sha256": "ad997d35103260158b68a7cdc8eedc11ae26b1beb1f871f309dd28ac78a6dbc9", "ja": "うーん、さすがに時間がかかりすぎてるな。\nちょっと様子を見に行ってみるか……。", "zh": "嗯——确实花的时间太长了。\n要不要去看看情况……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0373_1002_028ari", "source_sha256": "316819d8013dbca187c220ca4a33859b603c5650f38e77bfecd5145408126e98", "ja": "ふっふっふ……！\n{$P$}さん、誰かをお探しですか？", "zh": "呵呵呵……！{$P$}先生，您是在找谁吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0373_1003_p", "source_sha256": "b79e59bf0656565772af3936da04f79be2388c57ea5723613ccb4b7a5c3e20c4", "ja": "ああ、亜利沙を探して……ハッ！\nそこにいるのは誰だ！", "zh": "啊，我正在找亚利沙……哈！\n在那里的是谁！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0373_1004_028ari", "source_sha256": "b96c72bcd16812668ee4a4772d503e8343de6438e6f9722536612db740f25255", "ja": "ムフフ♪　私はコードネーム『A.R.I.S.A』。\nこのまま気づかないんじゃないかと思いました……。", "zh": "嘿嘿♪我是代号“A.R.I.S.A”的人。\n我还以为你就这样一直都发现不了我呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0373_1005_028ari", "source_sha256": "c22ed60139b19460d78dedc3adb39f640b3566d113075b41d70d0b1e5afb5b47", "ja": "でもそのおかげで、\n{$P$}さんを十分、観察できました。", "zh": "不过也多亏了这样，\n我才能充分观察{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0373_1006_p", "source_sha256": "bb8204c0d26d1e8565836d40cc78d6108fd928346b138a61c4cc804d22bff66a", "ja": "な、なんだってー！\n……って言うか、観察？", "zh": "什、什么——！\n……话说回来，观察？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0373_1007_028ari", "source_sha256": "eef363b422e08e4d151ff6c4c5aeea6c1eb65a0776bd65024926a0245c23b603", "ja": "はい。まず……ありさと別れた後、\nスタッフさんと撮影の打ち合わせをしましたね。", "zh": "是的。首先……和亚利沙分别后，和工作人员商量了拍摄的事，对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0373_1008_028ari", "source_sha256": "379f1b9c5b766bf362a33cf97982a57c4429a068a480fac1d3aeb54811a99de2", "ja": "その後、自動販売機でコーヒーを買って休憩。\n劇場に一度電話をし、ここでありさを待っていた……。", "zh": "之后，我在自动售货机买了咖啡休息。\n还给剧场打过一次电话，然后就在这里等着有纱……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0373_1009_p", "source_sha256": "aea1d57e4d33358066b95049483cf3e67c6040c60128904470c0f86f93c3e0d7", "ja": "おお、合ってるな。まさか本当に観察して……\nん？　でもそれだと、ちょっとおかしいな。", "zh": "哦，没错。难道真的一直在观察……嗯？可是这样一来，就有点奇怪了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0373_1010_p", "source_sha256": "4bea70606671e6d1356bc7457fb2bc79ddf66f0c031534f4c744d34a2eccada8", "ja": "亜利沙が着替えてる間は観察ができないはずだ。\n別れた直後の情報は、どうやって知ったんだ？", "zh": "亚利沙换衣服的时候应该没法观察才对。\n那分开之后的情报，你是怎么知道的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0373_1011_028ari", "source_sha256": "87ef16e1479003b9a891466813d5fa8303bd84da07689d451ca396bca082cde2", "ja": "ギクッ！？　えっと……それはその……。\nす、スパイのヒミツですっ！！", "zh": "咯噔！？　那个……这个嘛……。\n这、这是间谍的秘密！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0373_1012_p", "source_sha256": "9fa644c4e28a91c3189e4db0e4205bf43dc9ba4ca2cc6c68c1abfbe959a02ad3", "ja": "（……スパイのヒミツとは？　ふむ。撮影が終わったら\nきちんと話を聞かないといけないな）", "zh": "（……所谓的间谍秘密？唔。拍摄结束后，\n一定得好好问问她才行）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0373_1013_028ari", "source_sha256": "f5c33a53d0149c287aadb647941a1f24a92bf20f20b9ed6b408c1863eb1b32fa", "ja": "でもでも、ありさの諜報活動は、\n今日から始まったわけじゃありませんよ！", "zh": "但是但是，亚利沙的谍报活动可不是从今天才开始的哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0373_1014_p", "source_sha256": "bc697ceca5001deac8a05efa45d3832519b5f10a23f53396b0410fbbc44789f4", "ja": "ん？　どういう事だ？", "zh": "嗯？这是什么意思？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0373_1015_028ari", "source_sha256": "bd8c2ebd2a17177cf77e91fb17f93c6604628f438b1e649426bfd56aa6c6c247", "ja": "役作りの一環として、劇場に来たお客さんに、\nスパイのイメージについて、リサーチしてみたんです！", "zh": "作为塑造角色的一环，我向来剧场的客人们，\n调查了一下大家对间谍的印象！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0373_1016_p", "source_sha256": "7e9a501327a3ee46166ada026a789ab9a7d9d889e0d305cb57cb65bbb4e7e4b9", "ja": "そういえば、出番がない日も劇場にきてると思ってたが\n……。そんな事して、よくバレなかったな？", "zh": "说起来，我还以为你连没安排演出的日子也会来剧场……做了那种事，居然没被发现啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0373_1017_028ari", "source_sha256": "c365632749369899517156d506c624b6bb4e321c8849599d893a17ad39b84579", "ja": "心配ご無用ですっ！　細心の注意を払いましたから！\nみなさん「喜んで協力するよ」って言ってくれました。", "zh": "不用担心！因为我可是非常小心的！\n大家还跟我说“很乐意帮忙哦”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0373_1018_p", "source_sha256": "d53df3b1667abb8e434ee9ab17fad0ebd73c7995faaaa82033c1fe1bf8f6b887", "ja": "いや、それは……。まぁいいか。頑張った役作りの成果\n今日の撮影で見せてもらわなきゃな。", "zh": "不，那个……算了。今天拍摄时，可得让我看看你努力塑造角色的成果啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0373_1019_028ari", "source_sha256": "47c370b0d73d5aa7eb7ca04fc71dac53e48ca7bdbe08853ed15a86b8406ef774", "ja": "はい！　任せてください{$P$}さん！\nありさ、かっこいいスパイになってみせますよーっ！", "zh": "好的！交给我吧，{$P$}先生！\n亚利沙一定会努力成为帅气的间谍——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
